---
import Doc from '../../../layouts/Doc.astro';
import Pager from '../../../components/Pager.astro';
const slug = 'concepts/trace-log';
---
<Doc slug={slug} title="Trace log">
  <h1>Trace log</h1>
  <p class="lede">Cortex records Axon events and the exact model requests and replies in JSONL.</p>
  <h2>Event and wire records</h2>
  <p>Runtime events record tool calls and usage. <code>wire_request</code> and <code>wire_reply</code> record the model traffic that produced them.</p>
  <h2>Storage</h2>
  <p>Files are written below the platform's user cache directory in <code>cortex/trace/</code>. Cortex prints the path on stderr at startup.</p>
  <h2>Failure behavior</h2>
  <p>If the trace file cannot be opened, Cortex logs the error and continues the run. A write failure is ignored by the trace sink.</p>
  <div class="docs-pager"><Pager slug={slug} /></div>
</Doc>
